  "title": "MARTEN TRANSPORT ANNOUNCES SALE OF ASSETS RELATED TO INTERMODAL BUSINESS",
  "summary": "MONDOVI, Wis., July 22, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Marten Transport, Ltd. (Nasdaq/GS:MRTN) announced today it has entered into an agreement to sell assets related to its intermodal business to Hub Group, Inc. (NASDAQ: HUBG). The transaction is structured as an asset sale of certain intermodal equipment, including over 1,200 refrigerated containers, and contracts to Hub…",
